  "note": "EP72 Lac-Megantic, night of 5-6 July 2013. An October repair shop, a rail yard under floodlight, a hand brake being wound, a town of six thousand at one in the morning, one fire appliance, seven miles of downgrade, then five years of paper and a courtroom that acquitted everybody. The bible bars sensationalism absolutely: no explosion, no screaming, no rescue. The filing cabinet is as loud as the train. MEASURED: 85 cues / 29.5 min = 2.87/min PASS."
